  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your eyewear with AO Eyewear's Original Pilots Sunglasses, crafted as genuine Pilots Sunglasses. Made in the USA, these aviator-style sunglasses blend timeless style with American-made quality. The selection includes various frame colors and sizes to suit your preferences. Enjoy optimal eye protection with 98% UVA and 100% UVB ray defense, shielding your eyes from the sun's harmful rays. The flagship Classic Aviator design features bayonet-style temples curving inward, allowing a comfortable fit under helmets or headphones.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
