  "description": "<p>Elevate your eyewear with AO Eyewear's Original Pilots Sunglasses, crafted as genuine Pilots Sunglasses. Made in the USA, these aviator-style sunglasses blend timeless style with American-made quality. The selection includes various frame colors and sizes to suit your preferences. Enjoy optimal eye protection with 98% UVA and 100% UVB ray defense, shielding your eyes from the sun's harmful rays. The flagship Classic Aviator design features bayonet-style temples curving inward, allowing a comfortable fit under helmets or headphones. The wide nose bridge sets the lenses apart for a distinctive look. These aviator sunglasses not only exude style but also prioritize functionality. The American-made craftsmanship ensures durability and reliability. Choose from a range of frame sizes and colors to match your personal style. Each pair of AO Eyewear Original Pilots Sunglasses comes with a deluxe carrying case, offering both protection and style. Enhance your eyewear collection with these iconic aviators that stand the test of time.</p>",
